{"id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-restricted-cnf-notation.md","title":"第三版 Chomsky 范式的兼容类记号","display":"df-restricted-cnf-notation — 第三版 Chomsky 范式的兼容类记号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","display":"df-restricted-cnf-notation — 第三版 Chomsky 范式的兼容类记号","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]"],"aliases":["73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","73-definition-4.5"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 271–275; PDF pp. 293–297; migrated historical interface","source_status":"source-form-checked; historical nonstandard restriction removed","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Legacy nonstandard interface; contrast Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; not the book CNF definition","legacy_source_status":"legacy-nonstandard-variant; not book CNF; side conditions retained","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"df-restricted-cnf-notation — 第三版 Chomsky 范式的兼容类记号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd76b0e857c90848\" href=\"?note=cd76b0e857c90848\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf\">73-df-epsilon-free-cnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-restricted-cnf-notation</span><span>73-definition-4.5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 271–275; PDF pp. 293–297; migrated historical interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-form-checked; historical nonstandard restriction removed"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Legacy nonstandard interface; contrast Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; not the book CNF definition"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"legacy-nonstandard-variant; not book CNF; side conditions retained"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>终结字母表固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=T\">\\(\\Sigma=T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFG}=\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFG}=\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}_0\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}_0\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd76b0e857c90848\" href=\"?note=cd76b0e857c90848\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf\">73-df-epsilon-free-cnf</a>；候选文法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\)</span>。保留历史文件名、aliases 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 入口，当前含义统一为第三版无空词的 Chomsky 范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNF}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in V^2\\lor\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in V^2\\lor\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>删除旧接口中禁止 S→a 的非标准条件，也不在本接口加入 S→ε。第三版 §7.1.5 先删除空词，再使用 A→BC 或 A→a；单字母语言现在可以直接用 S→a 表示。需要保留空词时可使用本册显式标为本地扩展的 standard-cnf。旧定义原文保存在本轮基线备份及 legacy_source_ref 中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma=T$，$\\mathrm{CFG}=\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 采用 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]。$\\operatorname{CNF}_0$ 采用 [[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]；候选文法 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}$。保留历史文件名、aliases 和 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 入口，当前含义统一为第三版无空词的 Chomsky 范式。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma=T$，$\\mathrm{CFG}=\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 采用 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]。$\\operatorname{CNF}_0$ 采用 [[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]；候选文法 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}$。保留历史文件名、aliases 和 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 入口，当前含义统一为第三版无空词的 Chomsky 范式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CFG}=\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CNF}_0","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in V^2\\lor\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle]\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2073,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation|第三版 Chomsky 范式的兼容类记号]]"},{"id":"248908af8dc82492","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c0217e1a08a868eb","cd76b0e857c90848"]}